⚠️ MEDIUM: Rate limiting yok! Brute force / DoS riski!

🛡️ 1. Laravel Rate Limiter:
   # app/Providers/RouteServiceProvider.php:
   protected function boot() {
       RateLimiter::for('api', function (Request $request) {
           return Limit::perMinute(60)->by($request->user()?->id ?: $request->ip());
       });
   }

🛡️ 2. Route'a uygula:
   Route::middleware('throttle:60,1')->group(function () {
       // api routes
   });

🛡️ 3. Nginx rate limiting:
   http {
       limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=api:10m rate=1r/s;
       server {
           location /api/ {
               limit_req zone=api burst=2 nodelay;
           }
       }
   }

🛡️ 4. Laravel Sanctum (SPA/mobile):
   # config/sanctum.php:
   'stateful_domain' => 'https://app.example.com',

🔗 Ref: https://laravel.com/docs/rate-limiting
